  <item>
    <title>vol.4 在30岁门前张望着的我们</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/64608398306513184ce6bb7f</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">64608398306513184ce6bb7f</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 14 May 2023 06:45:43 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期节目由27岁的狗子和吉吉录制，聊了对即将到来的30岁有哪些预设和感受，秉持着纯主观的原则从社会、家庭和个人三个的维度讨论了我们的财务状况、婚恋困惑以及精神状态。</span></p><span></span><p><span>感谢收听！同时也欢迎大家在评论区留言分享你的“30岁”。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>收听指南：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="85">01:25</a> &nbsp;“狗吉跳墙”组合重磅首发</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="141">02:21</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;有点疯但不完全，先给大家做个介绍&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="338">05:38</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;当“30”成为公认人生关键节点</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="549">09:09</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;想象与现实，当财务自由成为渴望</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="826">13:46</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;该长大的“孩子”，家庭关系的分割期</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1032">17:12</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;年纪到了，这婚还真难结</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1522">25:22</a> &nbsp;在平衡关系中成长起来的个人精神力</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1993">33:13</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;总会到来的精神切割，成长为“情绪稳定”的大人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2196">36:36</a> &nbsp;又是一年母亲节，call back一下往期节目</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2251">37:31</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;30岁的我们呀，健康快乐且无所畏惧地往前走吧</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;慢慢来，总会30岁的，30岁也总会过去的~</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lhll3o2m9WxFN9ZXsi5B1fsCz07A.m4a" length="38648719" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:39:47</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cHM6Ly9pbWFnZS54eXpjZG4ubmV0L0ZtR1o3VVgwb05ncUFYT01feWhBWWhEZHVrNjYucG5n.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>vol.3 浅聊唐山烧烤店打人事件，愿你我保持愤怒与勇敢</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/62a69011525536dd029367ae</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">62a69011525536dd029367ae</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 13 Jun 2022 01:17:04 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期节目围绕“唐山烧烤店打人事件”展开，我们第一次邀请了男生朋友作为嘉宾加入我们的讨论，使我们的观点更加多元化，但核心始终是希望暴力能被消除，善良不被辜负，每一个你我都能够安心地行走于每一个角落。</span></p><span></span><p><span>特别提示：案件相关信息需以官方通报为准，不信谣不传谣。本期所述内容均为个人观点，拒绝一切谩骂引战行为。感谢收听，祝平安喜乐。</span></p><span></span><p><span>收听指南：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="113">01:53</a> &nbsp;正式开场——我们有特邀嘉宾了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="168">02:48</a> &nbsp;暴力事件——你也在愤怒或恐惧吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="817">13:37</a> &nbsp;“强弱”之间——那未被“看见”的不安全感</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="987">16:27</a> &nbsp;关于勇气——旁观者的抉择无关对错</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1480">24:40</a> &nbsp;“无解”之题——罪恶之源与保护之力</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1874">31:14</a> &nbsp;谈起对策——进步之后还是进步</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2194">36:34</a> &nbsp;人言可畏——造谣有罪受害者无罪，</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2494">41:34</a> &nbsp;“男女有别”——无法感同身受的遭遇</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3252">54:12</a> &nbsp;有碰撞才能出火花，保护我方稀有嘉宾</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3374">56:14</a> &nbsp;我的选择——你也曾想过“同归于尽”吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3705">1:01:45</a> &nbsp;你的善意——谢谢，但我想要有表达愤怒的勇气</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4468">1:14:28</a> &nbsp;举个例子——问就是“girls help girls！”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5084">1:24:44</a> &nbsp;善良的你——保护也可以有多种方式</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5163">1:26:03</a> &nbsp;最后我们想说：无论前进或后退，愿你有勇气走到有光的地方</span></p><span></span><p><span>引用内容：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1578">26:18</a> &nbsp;@治宝蛋 2022-6-11微博内容</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2978">49:38</a> &nbsp;《人生第二次》第四集</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4060">1:07:40</a> &nbsp;@北京眼科医生陶勇 2022-6-11微博内容</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5213">1:26:53</a> &nbsp;《但是还有书籍》第二季</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5310">1:28:30</a> &nbsp;《杀死一只知更鸟》</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lm-CDXo6wOjMokoQVCi-cofSZABJ.m4a" length="127329358" type="audio/mp4"/>
