  <item>
    <title>vol1.废话真多成立！聊聊疫情下普通少女们的焦虑瞬间</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/626e540abf39836fd02b7a20</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">626e540abf39836fd02b7a20</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 01 May 2022 09:34:01 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>第一期的录制，正值五一假期之际，前一年欢聚于长沙的六人组今年只能网络大团圆，聊一聊我们为什么要开设电台，以及聊一聊因为疫情，我们的生活都有哪些变化。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>特别提示：本期节目中涉及的疫情防控相关政策会因地区和时间有所不同，听众朋友们谨慎参考，具体情况以所在地官方信息为准，疫情防控人人有责哦！</span></strong></p><span></span><p><em><span>收听指南：</span></em></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="46">00:46</a> &nbsp;第一期正式开始，一个极简介绍</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="127">02:07</a> &nbsp;疫情对“普通少女们”生活的影响</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="416">06:56</a> &nbsp;疫情使人无槽可跳</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="805">13:25</a> &nbsp;“掉队”的老年生活</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1054">17:34</a> &nbsp;被颠覆的学生时代</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1319">21:59</a> &nbsp;突如其来的相亲局？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2005">33:25</a> &nbsp;习惯=正常吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2356">39:16</a> &nbsp;应届生的哀嚎</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3034">50:34</a> &nbsp;“因为懂得，所以慈悲”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3251">54:11</a> &nbsp;一个没有升华的ending</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期主播：已婚王女士、吉吉、狗子、嘻嘻、黄老师和顺顺~（按出场顺序~）</span></p><span></span><p><span>剪辑：狗子</span></p><span></span><p><span>文案：吉吉</span></p><span></span><p><span>BGM：밤하늘에서 별을（2020）</span></p>]]></description>
